		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="col-12">
<h4 class="product-fields__title">DETALLES DEL PRODUCTO</h4>
</div>
<div class="col-12 product-fields__table">
<div class="row align-items-center product-fields__row product-custom_field">
<div class="col-12 col-md-3"><span class="product-fields__subtitle">Tipo de Alimento: </span>Seco</div>
</div>
<div class="row align-items-center product-fields__row product-custom_field">
<div></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-3"><span class="product-fields__subtitle">Calidad: </span>Premium</div>
</div>
<div class="row align-items-center product-fields__row product-custom_field">
<div></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-3"><span class="product-fields__subtitle">Ingredientes:</span></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-9">
<div class="product-fields__content product-custom_field_values"><span id="product-custom_field_value_11723991" class="product-custom_field_value">Harina de carne y hueso de cordero, arroz, gluten de maíz, arvejas, maíz, germen de maíz, aceite de pollo, pulpa de remolacha (fuente de fructooligosacáridos), hidrolizado de hígado porcino, aceite de pescado, levadura de cerveza, zeolita, extracto de Yucca schidigera, sal, lisina, metionina, sorbato de potasio, extracto de romero, lecitina, tocoferoles, BHA, BHT, ácido cítrico, Vitaminas: A, B1, B2, B6, B12, C, D3, E, K3, ácido fólico, niacina, ácido pantoténico, biotina, colina. Minerales: zinc, hierro, cobre, yodo, manganeso y selenio.</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row align-items-center product-fields__row product-custom_field">
<div></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-3"><span class="product-fields__subtitle">Raza: </span>Todas</div>
</div>
<div class="row align-items-center product-fields__row product-custom_field">
<div class="col-12 col-md-3"><span class="product-fields__subtitle">Etapa: </span>Adulto</div>
</div>
<div class="row align-items-center product-fields__row product-custom_field">
<div></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-3"><span class="product-fields__subtitle">Tabla Nutricional</span></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-9">
<div class="product-fields__content product-custom_field_values"><span id="product-custom_field_value_11723994" class="product-custom_field_value">Composición centesimal Mín. (%) Máx. (%) Proteína bruta 26% - Extracto etéreo 13% - Fibra cruda - 3% Minerales totales - 9% Humedad - 11% Calcio 1% 2% Fósforo 0,7% 1,2%</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row align-items-center product-fields__row product-custom_field">
<div class="col-12 col-md-3"><span class="product-fields__subtitle">Composición:</span></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-9">
<div class="product-fields__content product-custom_field_values"><span id="product-custom_field_value_12790025" class="product-custom_field_value">Vitalcan Premium perro adulto Cordero proporciona: 26% de proteína Piel sana y pelo brillante. Croqueta exclusiva. Sin soja Sin trigo Sin colorantes</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>]]></content:encoded>
